Description: \code{fwatlasbc} is an R package for querying data from the Freshwater Atlas (FWA) of British Columbia (<https://www2.gov.bc.ca/gov/content/data/geographic-data-services/topographic-data/freshwater>). Spatial data are returned as simple features (<https://github.com/r-spatial/sf>). \code{fwatlasbc} wraps \code{fwapgr} (<https://github.com/poissonconsulting/fwapgr>); an R package that uses the fwapg API (<https://www.hillcrestgeo.ca/fwapg/index.html>).
